## Model card

- **Name:** Grok Build 0.1
- **Short description:** Dedicated coding model; distinct from the Grok Build application, which can run newer models.
- **Provider / access:** SpaceXAI Responses API, `https://api.x.ai/v1/responses`, model `grok-build-0.1`; also OpenRouter.
- **Release / knowledge:** Public API beta May 29, 2026; knowledge cutoff unverified. [Publisher launch](https://x.ai/news/grok-build-0-1)
- **IDs:** `grok-build-0.1`; OpenRouter `x-ai/grok-build-0.1`. No verified Zen Free ID.
- **Context window:** 256,000 tokens; no separately verified output ceiling.
- **Modalities:** Text/image input, text output; reasoning, function calling and structured outputs.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-08):** $1 input / $2 output / $0.20 cached input per million tokens. Documentation flags different rates above 200K, but those rates were not exposed in the retrieved page. [Official model specification and prices](https://docs.x.ai/developers/models/grok-build-0.1)
- **Architecture:** Proprietary; parameters undisclosed. [Evaluator model record](https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/grok-build-0-1-06-16)

### Raw benchmarks found

- Agent/tool use: PinchBench reports **92.1% best**, **88.9% average**, range **86.6–92.1%** for this model. Best-run selection is not average reliability; no universal leaderboard rank inferred. [Evaluator record](https://pinchbench.com/model/x-ai/x-ai/grok-build-0.1). The listed best run uses benchmark **2.0.0**, OpenClaw **2026.5.4**. [Run list](https://pinchbench.com/runs)
- Reasoning: Artificial Analysis historically reports **41** on Intelligence Index **v4.1.1** for the June 16 snapshot. [Evaluator comparison](https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/comparisons/grok-build-0-1-06-16-vs-gpt-5-5-low)
- The current model page instead shows **27**, explicitly marked **estimated**, with the **v4.3.2** suite. This is not a new measured score or evidence of regression. [Current evaluator page](https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/grok-build-0-1-06-16)
- Coding: secondary host/aggregator pages quote a Coding Index, but the underlying evaluator measurement and configuration were not recovered. No verified primary SWE-bench/Pro, LiveCodeBench, SciCode, DeepSWE or Vibe Code Bench score found.
- Terminal-Bench 2.1, Tau3/Tau2, GDPval-AA, Claw, Toolathon, MCP-Atlas, SWE Atlas, GPQA, HLE, LCR/MLCR, CritPt and Omniscience: no verified public score found in primary material retrieved.
- Long context: no verified full-window MRCR/RULER/GraphWalks result found. Image support is documented, but quantitative vision evidence was not verified.

### Normalized scores (1–100)

**Self-excluded: insufficient verified evidence for a complete Overall assessment.** Agent evidence and an older composite are preserved, but assigning coding and reasoning dimensions from unrecovered component scores would add unsupported precision. No placeholder scores are supplied. Revisit when primary component benchmarks for a pinned snapshot are accessible.

